## Settings

Settings ni sehemu inayompa mtumiaji uwezo wa kubadilisha tabia ya Nexas kulingana na mapendeleo yake binafsi. Hii inahakikisha app inabaki rahisi kutumia na inalingana na mazingira tofauti ya mtumiaji.

### Vipengele vya Settings
- **Thresholds:** Weka kiwango cha chini (mfano 20%) na cha juu (mfano 80%) cha betri kwa arifa na auto‑recharge.
- **Notifications:** Chagua aina ya arifa (sound, vibration, silent mode).
- **Profiles:** Badilisha profile (Home, Travel, Night) kulingana na mazingira.
- **Language:** Badilisha lugha ya interface (mfano Kiswahili ↔ English).
- **Security:** Dhibiti ruhusa za data na encryption settings.
- **Network:** Weka mother source ID (mfano `Mama1956407897`) na API key kwa mawasiliano salama.
- **Battery Options:** Angalia afya ya betri, overheating alerts, na capacity display.

### Jedwali la Settings
| Kipengele        | Maelezo                                    | Mfano               |
|------------------|---------------------------------------------|---------------------|
| Thresholds       | Kiwango cha chini/juu cha betri             | 20% / 80%           |
| Notifications    | Aina ya arifa                               | Sound / Vibration   |
| Profiles         | Tabia za mazingira                          | Home / Travel / Night |
| Language         | Lugha ya interface                          | Kiswahili / English |
| Security         | Ruhusa na encryption                        | Enabled             |
| Network          | Mother source ID na API key                 | Mama1956407897      |
| Battery Options  | Afya, overheating, capacity                 | Good / 45°C / 4000mAh |

### Faida kwa Mtumiaji
- Urahisi wa kubadilisha tabia ya app bila kuingia kwenye code.
- App inabaki rafiki na inayolingana na mazingira ya mtumiaji.
- Husaidia kuongeza ufanisi na usalama wa betri.
